<mujocoinclude>
  <!--
    Independent Color and Depth stream layout (11 values):

      color_width color_height color_vfov_deg
      depth_width depth_height depth_vfov_deg
      common_fps depth_enabled depth_min_m depth_max_m preview_enabled

    Enable exactly one <user> element. Color and Depth values may be combined
    independently when both modes are supported at the selected common FPS.
    FOV values below were calculated as 2*atan(height/(2*fy)) from the SDK
    intrinsics measured on the connected physical cameras on 2026-08-01:
      D435I SN 349422070502; Gemini 335 SN CP0F4630000L.
  -->

  <!-- ENABLED: Intel RealSense D435I.
       Color 1280x720, fy=909.874146, VFOV 43.173360 deg;
       Depth 848x480, fy=427.622711, VFOV 58.605976 deg; common 30 Hz. -->
